# Per-repo napkin runbook (`napkin` skill) — local-only working notes. Names the
# operator's own filesystem layout (/Users/…) and the prod container, and this repo
# is PUBLIC, so it stays out of git. Same class as ops/scripts/.disk-forensics-hosts
# above. NOTE: `.claude/` is only PARTIALLY ignored (worktrees + this file) — it
# still holds tracked files (settings.json, launch.json, commands/), so an
# unignored file here WOULD be swept in by `git add -A`, which CLAUDE.md bans for
# exactly this reason. (OPS-ENDPOINT-TRUTH-VAULT-QUARANTINE-W1)
/.claude/napkin.md
